Audeo-2 v0.1.0

A modern desktop application for downloading and managing audio and video content 
from online platforms with video information analysis capabilities.

Features:
- Video information extraction and analysis
- Audio and video downloads
- Format selection and quality control
- Proxy support with authentication
- Modern GUI built with Toga

This license allows free use, modification, and distribution of the software
while maintaining copyright attribution.

For more information about the project, visit:
https://github.com/Eclouf/Audeo